# Copy to .secrets (gitignored) and fill in a real value before running `act`.
#
# GITHUB_TOKEN: use a PAT scoped to public-repo READ ONLY (metadata/contents:read).
# Do NOT give this token `write:packages` — ggen-ecosystem-container.yml really
# does `docker/login-action` + `push: true` against ghcr.io/seanchatmangpt/
# ggen-ecosystem, and its act-local recipe only stays safe (build-only, no
# push) because of the workflow-file guard, not because this token lacks the
# scope. This token exists to (a) raise act's own GitHub API rate limit when
# resolving ~15 distinct pinned actions across 7 workflows, and (b) give
# actions/checkout a valid (but low-privilege) auth header.
GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
